# Repository Agent Guidance

Read [`contracts.mdc`](contracts.mdc) before planning, editing, delegating, or reviewing.

Use `manager-agent` for work spanning multiple roles. The manager assigns exclusive file ownership and integrates specialist handoffs.

Available specialists:

- `frontend-developer`
- `backend-developer`
- `test-developer`
- `cicd-developer`

Detect repository stack from checked-in evidence. Support JavaScript, TypeScript, Java, and Python. Apply React, Node.js, PyTorch, or LangChain guidance only when detected.

Run every test, build, and validation command inside a sandbox. Follow the [sandbox contract](contracts.mdc#sandbox-contract). Without a sandbox, stop and report an `environment` failure. Run unsandboxed only after explicit user authorization.

Repository-specific instructions take precedence, except sandbox requirements. User instructions remain authoritative.
